1
00:01:50,500 --> 00:01:51,000
Made up your mind?

2
00:01:52,659 --> 00:01:53,780
I'm here, aren't I?

3
00:01:54,719 --> 00:01:56,140
When do you let Xueting go?

4
00:02:01,579 --> 00:02:03,019
Freeing a suspect like him

5
00:02:03,540 --> 00:02:04,620
isn't easy.

6
00:02:05,519 --> 00:02:06,540
The evidence is solid.

7
00:02:07,180 --> 00:02:08,300
There are protocols to follow.

8
00:02:09,740 --> 00:02:11,400
But I'm a man of my word.

9
00:02:13,419 --> 00:02:14,520
He'll make it out alive.

10
00:02:17,740 --> 00:02:18,139
Good.

11
00:02:20,180 --> 00:02:21,099
Let's get this over with.

12
00:02:57,379 --> 00:02:57,939
What's wrong?

13
00:02:59,479 --> 00:03:00,439
Not here?

14
00:03:01,580 --> 00:03:02,419
Then where?

15
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:23,139
You'd stoop this low

16
00:03:25,039 --> 00:03:26,680
for that guy?

17
00:03:28,340 --> 00:03:28,860
Yeah.

18
00:03:33,099 --> 00:03:34,419
Isn't this what you wanted?

19
00:03:42,300 --> 00:03:42,819
Alright.

20
00:03:44,639 --> 00:03:45,319
You asked for it.

21
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:04,819
You were so ready a second ago.

22
00:04:05,659 --> 00:04:06,139
What?

23
00:04:08,379 --> 00:04:08,900
Cold feet already?

24
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:16,339
Make up your mind next time.

25
00:05:19,220 --> 00:05:21,040
I want passion,

26
00:05:22,860 --> 00:05:24,300
not a martyr.

27
00:06:38,300 --> 00:06:39,040
[What the hell do you want?]

28
00:06:40,339 --> 00:06:41,740
[What is it that I can't give you?]

29
00:06:42,500 --> 00:06:43,819
[I want something real.]

30
00:06:45,300 --> 00:06:46,839
[A love with respect, equality...]

31
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:48,680
[and complete devotion.]

32
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:52,639
I'll never let you

33
00:07:52,639 --> 00:07:54,300
be with anyone else...

34
00:07:55,779 --> 00:07:57,139
Ye Pingjun...

35
00:07:59,779 --> 00:08:01,560
Ye Pingjun...

36
00:08:03,740 --> 00:08:05,399
Pingjun...

37
00:08:21,860 --> 00:08:23,480
Miss, why the tears?

38
00:08:24,459 --> 00:08:25,860
You're on soon.

39
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:28,319
Don't smudge your makeup.

40
00:08:58,519 --> 00:09:03,659
Bravo!

41
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:21,679
[I knew that girl]

42
00:09:21,679 --> 00:09:23,240
[had tricks up her sleeve.]

43
00:09:23,460 --> 00:09:24,559
[Meanwhile,]

44
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:27,240
[someone's waited for years,]

45
00:09:27,919 --> 00:09:29,039
[only to be treated]

46
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:30,820
[like a toy to]

47
00:09:30,820 --> 00:09:31,759
[pass the time!]

48
00:09:33,639 --> 00:09:35,279
What is she doing?

49
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:36,220
Yeah,

50
00:09:36,379 --> 00:09:37,019
she never misses a beat!

51
00:09:37,019 --> 00:09:37,620
What's going on?

52
00:09:38,059 --> 00:09:38,980
Did you choke?

53
00:09:39,759 --> 00:09:40,919
Keep going!

54
00:09:40,919 --> 00:09:41,919
Cat got your tongue?

55
00:09:42,460 --> 00:09:43,679
[Meanwhile,]

56
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:46,000
[someone's waited for years,]

57
00:09:46,460 --> 00:09:47,519
[only to be treated]

58
00:09:47,740 --> 00:09:49,120
[like a toy to]

59
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:49,860
[pass the time!]

60
00:09:49,940 --> 00:09:50,779
[pass the time!]

61
00:09:50,820 --> 00:09:51,519
Sing already!

62
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:52,299
What the hell is this?

63
00:09:52,919 --> 00:09:53,539
Come on!

64
00:09:53,539 --> 00:09:54,179
Refund!

65
00:09:54,220 --> 00:09:54,779
Give my money back!

66
00:09:54,860 --> 00:09:55,440
C'mon!

67
00:09:55,519 --> 00:09:56,559
Boo!

68
00:09:56,740 --> 00:09:57,460
Boo!

69
00:10:03,559 --> 00:10:04,379
Refund!

70
00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:06,059
Boo!

71
00:10:07,039 --> 00:10:08,320
You've ruined us!

72
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:09,360
Get backstage!

73
00:10:11,639 --> 00:10:12,279
Folks,

74
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:14,440
please...

75
00:10:14,519 --> 00:10:15,840
I'm terribly sorry!

76
00:10:21,519 --> 00:10:22,440
Pick up the pace!

77
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:23,840
Watch the makeup!

78
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:25,340
No more screw-ups!

79
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:29,000
Froze out there, huh?

80
00:10:29,259 --> 00:10:30,379
Watch and learn!

81
00:10:30,740 --> 00:10:32,299
Please, zip it.

82
00:10:32,559 --> 00:10:33,600
We're counting on you

83
00:10:34,059 --> 00:10:35,539
to save the day.

84
00:10:40,539 --> 00:10:42,519
Headliner yesterday,

85
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:44,440
laughingstock today!

86
00:10:44,820 --> 00:10:46,539
Let's see you strut around after this.

87
00:10:47,019 --> 00:10:48,480
You're old news!

88
00:10:48,860 --> 00:10:49,980
OK, OK, sweetheart.

89
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:50,879
C'mon,

90
00:10:51,039 --> 00:10:52,340
get her to the stage.

91
00:10:52,860 --> 00:10:53,679
Mind the silks!

92
00:11:07,379 --> 00:11:07,980
Honey...

93
00:11:08,559 --> 00:11:10,399
Peachbud

94
00:11:10,620 --> 00:11:11,740
knows this part

95
00:11:12,200 --> 00:11:13,259
inside out.

96
00:11:14,340 --> 00:11:14,940
How about

97
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:17,340
taking a little break?

98
00:11:17,600 --> 00:11:18,440
I'll book you a new show.

99
00:11:35,899 --> 00:11:37,159
Hey! Lose the hat!

100
00:11:47,460 --> 00:11:47,980
General,

101
00:11:48,360 --> 00:11:49,059
we've got checkpoints

102
00:11:49,059 --> 00:11:49,879
at every gate.

103
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:51,659
Shang Hongwen won't slip through.

104
00:11:52,759 --> 00:11:53,500
Stay sharp.

105
00:11:54,059 --> 00:11:54,580
That

106
00:11:55,139 --> 00:11:56,500
slippery rat will surface soon.

107
00:11:56,740 --> 00:11:57,179
Yes, sir!

108
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:02,039
Where to, sir?

109
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:03,220
Home?

110
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:05,039
Imperial West, or Redleaf?

111
00:12:05,960 --> 00:12:06,639
To Redleaf.

112
00:12:06,879 --> 00:12:07,240
Understood, sir.

113
00:13:26,220 --> 00:13:27,320
You're hurting me.

114
00:13:38,399 --> 00:13:39,980
All those new dresses I got you...

115
00:13:40,620 --> 00:13:41,720
None of them to your taste?

116
00:13:42,220 --> 00:13:43,500
Hate the

117
00:13:43,919 --> 00:13:44,620
jewelry too?

118
00:13:48,080 --> 00:13:48,580
Let Bowen

119
00:13:49,659 --> 00:13:51,440
take you shopping then.

120
00:13:52,080 --> 00:13:54,000
Clear out the department store.

121
00:13:56,580 --> 00:13:57,659
I don't want her near me.

122
00:13:58,440 --> 00:13:59,399
I want nothing at all.

123
00:14:01,980 --> 00:14:03,240
Don't treat her like poison.

124
00:14:06,399 --> 00:14:07,200
What, should I

125
00:14:07,200 --> 00:14:08,259
kiss her boots instead?

126
00:14:25,360 --> 00:14:27,100
Been lazy all week, haven't you?

127
00:14:27,919 --> 00:14:29,860
Cramming right before

128
00:14:30,259 --> 00:14:32,120
your tutor comes?

129
00:14:32,639 --> 00:14:35,019
Mom, stop fussing over me!

130
00:14:35,200 --> 00:14:35,960
Go lecture Changxuan

131
00:14:35,960 --> 00:14:37,019
instead.

132
00:14:37,299 --> 00:14:39,039
He never sets foot

133
00:14:39,059 --> 00:14:39,659
in this house...

134
00:14:39,659 --> 00:14:41,120
Lord knows what he's up to.

135
00:14:41,620 --> 00:14:42,600
Fair point.

136
00:14:43,820 --> 00:14:44,600
He

137
00:14:44,919 --> 00:14:46,240
skipped dinner

138
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:47,340
for days.

139
00:14:48,320 --> 00:14:49,440
Zhou Tai said

140
00:14:49,799 --> 00:14:51,779
he's been living at Redleaf lately.

141
00:14:55,600 --> 00:14:56,200
Zhou Tai,

142
00:14:57,419 --> 00:14:59,279
what is Changxuan up to

143
00:14:59,279 --> 00:15:00,220
at Redleaf lately?

144
00:15:00,360 --> 00:15:01,100
Ma'am,

145
00:15:01,539 --> 00:15:02,940
I'm not entirely sure.

146
00:15:03,419 --> 00:15:04,379
Master Changxuan

147
00:15:04,399 --> 00:15:05,639
sent a cook there,

148
00:15:05,899 --> 00:15:07,139
and he's been very particular

149
00:15:07,179 --> 00:15:08,340
about the household provisions.

150
00:15:11,000 --> 00:15:11,580
Redleaf is

151
00:15:11,580 --> 00:15:13,440
gorgeous this time of year.

152
00:15:13,860 --> 00:15:15,860
Maybe he just needs some peace.

153
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:20,179
Whenever I ask him

154
00:15:20,179 --> 00:15:21,580
to take me there,

155
00:15:21,720 --> 00:15:24,480
and he's always "too busy with work."

156
00:15:24,820 --> 00:15:27,039
Says the place is like a tomb.

157
00:15:27,379 --> 00:15:29,080
Funny how he doesn't mind it now!

158
00:15:32,940 --> 00:15:34,100
Keep practicing!

159
00:15:35,580 --> 00:15:35,960
I heard you!

160
00:15:45,279 --> 00:15:46,360
It's late.

161
00:15:46,820 --> 00:15:48,659
Didn't know you had a thing

162
00:15:48,659 --> 00:15:49,720
for penmanship.

163
00:15:54,940 --> 00:15:56,220
Rather do something

164
00:15:56,740 --> 00:15:57,480
more thrilling?

165
00:16:06,480 --> 00:16:07,940
Everyone says my strokes

166
00:16:08,740 --> 00:16:09,940
are fierce.

167
00:16:10,580 --> 00:16:11,759
But I always feel

168
00:16:12,279 --> 00:16:13,799
they lack softness and grace.

169
00:16:15,059 --> 00:16:16,320
Yours is famous for its elegance.

170
00:16:17,379 --> 00:16:18,340
Show me how it's done.

171
00:16:19,559 --> 00:16:20,399
Count me out.

172
00:16:20,840 --> 00:16:22,200
Spare me the sarcasm.

173
00:16:22,460 --> 00:16:24,299
Find yourself a proper master.

174
00:16:32,779 --> 00:16:34,159
You want Xueting out alive?

175
00:16:35,179 --> 00:16:36,659
Then act like you mean it.

176
00:16:38,580 --> 00:16:39,580
Too proud to please me,

177
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:41,840
and too proud to teach me.

178
00:16:43,320 --> 00:16:45,639
Did I bring you here to be a statue?

179
00:17:18,019 --> 00:17:19,880
Isn't this the proper way to guide a pupil?

180
00:17:24,900 --> 00:17:26,519
Folks call this script style manly.

181
00:17:27,440 --> 00:17:30,200
Strict and disciplined.

182
00:17:31,180 --> 00:17:33,220
To me, it's pure woman:

183
00:17:34,339 --> 00:17:35,720
soft, teasing, full of secrets.

184
00:17:38,200 --> 00:17:39,359
The quiet strokes

185
00:17:40,599 --> 00:17:43,819
carry the real fire.

186
00:18:02,019 --> 00:18:03,819
The estate is covered in maples.

187
00:18:05,619 --> 00:18:07,059
In late fall,

188
00:18:07,700 --> 00:18:11,240
the leaves turn blood red.

189
00:18:12,039 --> 00:18:13,400
That's how it earned the name.

190
00:18:14,460 --> 00:18:15,500
When

191
00:18:16,099 --> 00:18:16,960
the trees turn,

192
00:18:18,740 --> 00:18:20,160
we'll walk through them.

193
00:18:26,599 --> 00:18:27,299
Your technique

194
00:18:27,299 --> 00:18:28,559
is impeccable.

195
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:29,680
I've got nothing left

196
00:18:29,680 --> 00:18:30,500
to show you.

197
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:38,160
Too dim.

198
00:18:38,359 --> 00:18:39,559
Bring that candle over.

199
00:18:57,319 --> 00:18:58,180
What are you up to?

200
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:01,559
You're a star student

201
00:19:02,019 --> 00:19:03,420
at school.

202
00:19:04,500 --> 00:19:05,680
Help me out with a classic verse.

203
00:19:06,640 --> 00:19:09,339
"Fragrant blooms beneath a shaded moon."

204
00:19:10,700 --> 00:19:11,980
What comes before this line?

205
00:19:19,440 --> 00:19:20,259
It slips my mind.

206
00:19:24,920 --> 00:19:25,819
Really? A sharp girl like you?

207
00:19:28,559 --> 00:19:29,740
"A moment in your arms

208
00:19:32,480 --> 00:19:33,480
is worth a king's ransom."

209
00:19:39,400 --> 00:19:40,279
Give it back!

210
00:20:00,779 --> 00:20:01,599
Yu Changxuan!

211
00:20:04,240 --> 00:20:05,460
Hear me!

212
00:20:05,940 --> 00:20:07,460
I'll curse your name until I die!

213
00:20:14,200 --> 00:20:15,039
Hear me,

214
00:20:15,640 --> 00:20:16,500
Ye Pingjun.

215
00:20:17,799 --> 00:20:18,740
Starting tonight,

216
00:20:19,440 --> 00:20:21,019
you won't keep a single trace

217
00:20:21,319 --> 00:20:22,660
of any other man on you.

218
00:20:37,680 --> 00:20:38,440
I see.

219
00:20:39,920 --> 00:20:40,740
Thank you.

220
00:20:45,920 --> 00:20:47,079
What did they say?

221
00:20:47,839 --> 00:20:50,619
Master Changxuan hasn't come back yet.

222
00:20:51,240 --> 00:20:52,000
He headed straight

223
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:53,200
for Redleaf.

224
00:20:57,299 --> 00:20:58,220
Leave me alone.

225
00:20:59,640 --> 00:21:00,440
Yes, Miss.

226
00:21:17,380 --> 00:21:18,960
[Step up your game, Lieutenant.]

227
00:21:19,819 --> 00:21:21,559
[Don't let another man]

228
00:21:22,420 --> 00:21:24,140
[do your job.]

229
00:21:29,779 --> 00:21:30,680
[God,]

230
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:32,160
[what a nightmare.]

231
00:21:32,200 --> 00:21:32,960
[Who could've]

232
00:21:32,960 --> 00:21:34,640
[seen it coming?]

233
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:37,000
[He would've done that]

234
00:21:37,240 --> 00:21:39,019
[for anybody.]

235
00:21:39,460 --> 00:21:40,819
[Still, it's nice to know]

236
00:21:41,359 --> 00:21:42,880
[my man]

237
00:21:43,119 --> 00:21:44,480
[has real guts.]

238
00:21:47,539 --> 00:21:49,059
[Changxuan is lucky]

239
00:21:49,440 --> 00:21:51,319
[to have you, sweetheart.]

240
00:22:02,940 --> 00:22:05,460
Miss, please! You'll hurt yourself!

241
00:22:28,500 --> 00:22:30,640
Call them again.

242
00:22:31,500 --> 00:22:32,819
Tell them

243
00:22:33,660 --> 00:22:35,119
I'm visiting Mrs. Yu tomorrow.

244
00:22:36,700 --> 00:22:37,400
Yes, Miss.

245
00:23:43,099 --> 00:23:44,700
Catching up

246
00:23:44,980 --> 00:23:46,180
on your reading, Lieutenant?

247
00:23:47,359 --> 00:23:48,240
A true gentleman

248
00:23:48,240 --> 00:23:49,180
among thugs.

249
00:23:51,519 --> 00:23:52,400
General,

250
00:23:54,039 --> 00:23:54,980
why am I

251
00:23:54,980 --> 00:23:56,059
not facing

252
00:23:57,420 --> 00:23:58,319
a firing squad?

253
00:23:58,539 --> 00:24:00,079
Because in this little game,

254
00:24:01,220 --> 00:24:02,960
you're entirely

255
00:24:02,960 --> 00:24:03,759
insignificant.

256
00:24:10,519 --> 00:24:11,500
Guess you

257
00:24:12,799 --> 00:24:13,900
cracked the case.

258
00:24:21,900 --> 00:24:23,220
Keep me alive

259
00:24:24,299 --> 00:24:25,400
behind bars...

260
00:24:26,880 --> 00:24:28,160
What's the play here?

261
00:24:30,900 --> 00:24:32,180
Isn't it

262
00:24:33,880 --> 00:24:34,779
obvious?

263
00:24:37,480 --> 00:24:38,319
Damn you!

264
00:24:46,500 --> 00:24:47,519
Lay a finger

265
00:24:47,519 --> 00:24:48,539
on Pingjun,

266
00:24:49,579 --> 00:24:50,500
and if I ever

267
00:24:50,500 --> 00:24:51,559
walk out alive,

268
00:24:52,319 --> 00:24:53,660
I'll kill you with my bare hands!

269
00:24:57,400 --> 00:24:58,539
I don't doubt the conviction.

270
00:24:59,400 --> 00:25:00,420
Only

271
00:25:01,599 --> 00:25:02,720
your

272
00:25:02,720 --> 00:25:03,779
competence.

273
00:25:14,279 --> 00:25:15,059
Yu Changxuan!

274
00:25:17,059 --> 00:25:18,099
Be a man

275
00:25:18,099 --> 00:25:18,759
and stop using

276
00:25:18,759 --> 00:25:19,619
such dirty tricks

277
00:25:19,880 --> 00:25:21,000
on her!

278
00:25:21,619 --> 00:25:22,460
With her pride,

279
00:25:22,500 --> 00:25:22,980
forcing her

280
00:25:23,619 --> 00:25:25,079
will never make her

281
00:25:25,079 --> 00:25:26,019
love you!

282
00:25:26,160 --> 00:25:27,339
Look who's talking.

283
00:25:29,720 --> 00:25:31,160
Did you tell her what you were into?

284
00:25:33,140 --> 00:25:34,900
Ever care if you

285
00:25:35,299 --> 00:25:36,579
dragged her down?

286
00:25:38,819 --> 00:25:40,440
Being a rat

287
00:25:41,140 --> 00:25:42,539
while asking for her hand.

288
00:25:44,279 --> 00:25:45,400
And you claim you care about her?

289
00:25:59,740 --> 00:26:01,079
I may not deserve her,

290
00:26:03,359 --> 00:26:04,140
but you're no home

291
00:26:04,140 --> 00:26:05,059
for her either!

292
00:26:07,220 --> 00:26:08,440
You're just

293
00:26:09,380 --> 00:26:10,559
a greedy warlord

294
00:26:10,559 --> 00:26:12,059
who takes whatever he wants.

295
00:26:13,460 --> 00:26:14,859
You're poison to her!

296
00:26:18,539 --> 00:26:19,500
Think again.

297
00:26:22,980 --> 00:26:23,779
I can give her

298
00:26:23,779 --> 00:26:25,039
the world.

299
00:26:29,119 --> 00:26:30,200
And you're gonna

300
00:26:30,200 --> 00:26:32,079
get a front-row seat

301
00:26:33,380 --> 00:26:35,279
watching her fall

302
00:26:35,279 --> 00:26:37,079
head over heels for me.

303
00:26:42,740 --> 00:26:43,740
You sick bastard!

304
00:26:46,559 --> 00:26:48,160
You'll rot in hell

305
00:26:50,099 --> 00:26:51,480
for this!

306
00:26:54,220 --> 00:26:56,200
If she is with me,

307
00:26:57,220 --> 00:26:58,759
hell is good enough for me.

308
00:27:25,440 --> 00:27:25,940
Sir,

309
00:27:26,599 --> 00:27:26,980
are we

310
00:27:26,980 --> 00:27:27,980
proceeding as planned?

311
00:27:28,740 --> 00:27:29,500
Proceed.

312
00:27:30,319 --> 00:27:31,180
Put the spy's execution

313
00:27:31,180 --> 00:27:32,039
in the papers.

314
00:27:32,539 --> 00:27:33,700
Open the docks

315
00:27:34,319 --> 00:27:35,319
and keep watch.

316
00:27:35,700 --> 00:27:36,819
Wait for our target to show himself.

317
00:27:37,779 --> 00:27:38,299
Right away, sir.

318
00:27:38,680 --> 00:27:39,200
Oh, sir,

319
00:27:39,640 --> 00:27:40,940
your mother called this morning.

320
00:27:41,140 --> 00:27:42,480
She requested your presence at home.

321
00:27:47,339 --> 00:27:48,240
Miss Ye...

322
00:27:49,740 --> 00:27:50,579
I beg you!

323
00:27:50,779 --> 00:27:52,079
You've gone without food or water,

324
00:27:52,160 --> 00:27:52,900
searching out here

325
00:27:52,900 --> 00:27:53,920
for hours.

326
00:27:54,099 --> 00:27:54,779
You'll run yourself

327
00:27:54,779 --> 00:27:56,019
ragged!

328
00:27:58,380 --> 00:27:59,180
Leave me be.

329
00:27:59,279 --> 00:28:00,019
I can't!

330
00:28:00,039 --> 00:28:01,200
Master Yu specifically told us

331
00:28:01,240 --> 00:28:02,240
to take good care

332
00:28:02,279 --> 00:28:03,579
of you!

333
00:28:23,700 --> 00:28:24,440
Miss Ye,

334
00:28:26,000 --> 00:28:27,079
careful!

335
00:28:34,480 --> 00:28:36,099
Not in the pond, please!

336
00:28:36,160 --> 00:28:37,460
The water is freezing!

337
00:28:38,519 --> 00:28:39,859
Please, get back here!

338
00:28:39,880 --> 00:28:40,900
What if you get sick?

339
00:28:43,940 --> 00:28:45,740
Your hand is cut!

340
00:28:46,940 --> 00:28:48,440
Please, stop!

341
00:28:48,940 --> 00:28:50,140
Just come out.

342
00:28:59,880 --> 00:29:00,740
I've got it!

343
00:29:09,000 --> 00:29:10,460
Sweetheart,

344
00:29:11,220 --> 00:29:13,640
so thoughtful of you to visit me.

345
00:29:14,460 --> 00:29:17,039
Ma, you're just her excuse.

346
00:29:17,640 --> 00:29:19,180
She's obviously here

347
00:29:19,180 --> 00:29:20,279
for Changxuan!

348
00:29:22,279 --> 00:29:23,339
Funny how

349
00:29:23,339 --> 00:29:24,779
he's a total stranger

350
00:29:25,240 --> 00:29:26,279
around this house lately!

351
00:29:26,420 --> 00:29:27,940
Watch your tongue.

352
00:29:28,519 --> 00:29:30,799
He is tied up with the military.

353
00:29:31,240 --> 00:29:32,940
Stop making excuses for him.

354
00:29:33,279 --> 00:29:34,059
People might

355
00:29:34,240 --> 00:29:35,200
start thinking he's got

356
00:29:35,200 --> 00:29:36,180
a mistress tucked away!

357
00:29:49,819 --> 00:29:51,319
Trash talking me again,

358
00:29:51,359 --> 00:29:52,279
Qixuan?

359
00:29:52,480 --> 00:29:54,160
Hands off my hair!

360
00:29:55,539 --> 00:29:56,319
Your bankroll is here.

361
00:29:56,319 --> 00:29:57,420
I'm out! Have fun!

362
00:30:00,779 --> 00:30:02,240
Enjoy, ladies. I need to brief Father.

363
00:30:03,039 --> 00:30:04,400
Oh, no you don't!

364
00:30:04,799 --> 00:30:05,880
I finally got

365
00:30:05,880 --> 00:30:07,079
a full table together,

366
00:30:07,339 --> 00:30:08,480
and you walk in

367
00:30:08,480 --> 00:30:09,779
and ruin it!

368
00:30:10,319 --> 00:30:12,000
Who's gonna fill in now?

369
00:30:12,819 --> 00:30:13,259
Sit.

370
00:30:16,240 --> 00:30:17,339
Am I such a

371
00:30:17,339 --> 00:30:18,720
terrible player

372
00:30:18,819 --> 00:30:19,900
that you won't grace our table?

373
00:30:20,220 --> 00:30:20,900
Quite the opposite.

374
00:30:21,740 --> 00:30:23,079
You're far too good.

375
00:30:23,519 --> 00:30:24,319
I'd lose my shirt in three hands.

376
00:30:28,180 --> 00:30:29,900
Oh, you two.

377
00:30:30,400 --> 00:30:33,180
House rule, though:

378
00:30:33,440 --> 00:30:36,480
no flirting during the game.

379
00:30:37,279 --> 00:30:39,099
Just a hand

380
00:30:39,140 --> 00:30:39,980
or two.

381
00:30:40,279 --> 00:30:41,160
If your father barks,

382
00:30:41,160 --> 00:30:42,299
I'll handle him.

383
00:30:42,900 --> 00:30:43,279
Sit!

384
00:30:44,299 --> 00:30:44,680
OK.

385
00:30:48,779 --> 00:30:49,500
Your draw.

386
00:30:54,420 --> 00:30:54,859
Eight bamboo.

387
00:30:55,299 --> 00:30:55,799
Claim!

388
00:31:13,579 --> 00:31:14,740
Nine bamboo.

389
00:31:17,539 --> 00:31:18,339
South wind.

390
00:31:23,039 --> 00:31:23,839
Three of Characters!

391
00:31:24,440 --> 00:31:25,039
I won!

392
00:31:25,240 --> 00:31:26,099
Already?

393
00:31:30,500 --> 00:31:31,380
Son,

394
00:31:31,799 --> 00:31:32,920
afraid to beat your sweetheart

395
00:31:32,920 --> 00:31:34,000
at the table?

396
00:31:35,880 --> 00:31:37,619
Just a cold streak. Have fun.

397
00:31:38,700 --> 00:31:39,819
Best go see Father

398
00:31:39,819 --> 00:31:40,859
before he blows up.

399
00:31:46,859 --> 00:31:47,940
A man

400
00:31:48,480 --> 00:31:49,500
needs a ring

401
00:31:49,500 --> 00:31:51,099
to tame him.

402
00:31:51,880 --> 00:31:53,599
One foot at the altar,

403
00:31:54,240 --> 00:31:55,660
and he's finally

404
00:31:56,059 --> 00:31:58,799
taking duty to heart.

405
00:32:02,779 --> 00:32:03,519
Auntie,

406
00:32:03,880 --> 00:32:05,160
why don't we get Minru in here,

407
00:32:05,440 --> 00:32:06,539
and have ourselves a real game?

408
00:32:07,059 --> 00:32:07,799
I'd love that.

409
00:32:08,140 --> 00:32:09,339
Bring Minru here.

410
00:32:09,559 --> 00:32:10,440
Yes, Madame.

411
00:32:11,140 --> 00:32:12,000
Won't be a moment.

412
00:32:43,799 --> 00:32:44,920
What's she doing here?

413
00:33:06,740 --> 00:33:08,140
That's Miss Lan's seat!

414
00:33:08,140 --> 00:33:09,480
Since when do you belong there?

415
00:33:09,640 --> 00:33:11,059
Open your damn eyes, b*tch!

416
00:33:13,900 --> 00:33:15,920
Who's headlining this house now?

417
00:33:16,599 --> 00:33:17,599
Packed seats

418
00:33:17,599 --> 00:33:19,000
every night for me!

419
00:33:19,900 --> 00:33:21,039
She fell flat

420
00:33:21,039 --> 00:33:22,279
on her face!

421
00:33:22,440 --> 00:33:23,940
The whole town is laughing at her!

422
00:33:24,640 --> 00:33:25,779
She just lost her focus

423
00:33:25,779 --> 00:33:26,940
for a second!

424
00:33:26,940 --> 00:33:28,339
She'll be back in top form in no time!

425
00:33:28,660 --> 00:33:29,480
You cheap little...

426
00:33:47,980 --> 00:33:54,759
Bravo!

427
00:33:58,440 --> 00:33:59,240
Encore!

428
00:33:59,900 --> 00:34:01,500
A slip on stage

429
00:34:01,880 --> 00:34:04,460
is suicide out here.

430
00:34:05,200 --> 00:34:07,579
Your blunder made the gossip columns.

431
00:34:08,079 --> 00:34:09,440
Pull that again,

432
00:34:09,800 --> 00:34:12,480
and your career's doomed.

433
00:34:17,440 --> 00:34:20,039
A trouper is no better

434
00:34:21,679 --> 00:34:24,119
than a dog.

435
00:34:26,639 --> 00:34:29,519
Strike up the band, pull the curtain,

436
00:34:31,139 --> 00:34:32,579
some new girl walks out,

437
00:34:32,579 --> 00:34:33,760
and you're yesterday's news.

438
00:34:40,519 --> 00:34:42,820
Fame is nothing but hot air.

439
00:34:58,940 --> 00:35:00,679
[I searched every shop in town]

440
00:35:01,500 --> 00:35:02,440
[for this.]

441
00:35:03,179 --> 00:35:03,820
[Hope it]

442
00:35:04,840 --> 00:35:05,619
[suits you.]

443
00:35:07,780 --> 00:35:09,099
[Welcome back, Master.]

444
00:35:24,900 --> 00:35:26,000
Why the jumpy look?

445
00:35:27,659 --> 00:35:28,719
Got a dagger

446
00:35:29,219 --> 00:35:30,300
under that pillow?

447
00:35:34,420 --> 00:35:35,800
Why turn in so early?

448
00:35:36,900 --> 00:35:39,400
Nothing... just exhausted.

449
00:35:40,199 --> 00:35:41,719
Stopped by the Old Table.

450
00:35:42,460 --> 00:35:43,900
Got their house specials,

451
00:35:44,539 --> 00:35:45,500
and some

452
00:35:47,119 --> 00:35:48,199
chicken soup dumplings.

453
00:35:50,440 --> 00:35:51,679
How did you know?

454
00:35:58,320 --> 00:35:59,460
Brought them just for you.

455
00:36:00,139 --> 00:36:00,960
Try some.

456
00:36:02,260 --> 00:36:03,599
See if it brings back old memories.

457
00:36:05,500 --> 00:36:06,519
I'm exhausted.

458
00:36:07,460 --> 00:36:08,539
I'll just skip.

459
00:36:09,300 --> 00:36:10,679
You can't just skip dinner.

460
00:36:11,420 --> 00:36:12,360
Just have some.

461
00:36:58,000 --> 00:36:59,099
You're something else, you know that?

462
00:37:02,039 --> 00:37:02,980
Managing to find this

463
00:37:02,980 --> 00:37:03,920
in an estate this size.

464
00:37:07,579 --> 00:37:08,800
Cowering in bed,

465
00:37:10,440 --> 00:37:11,960
mooning over a keepsake?

466
00:37:14,820 --> 00:37:15,860
Say what you want,

467
00:37:16,860 --> 00:37:18,260
it's still mine.

468
00:37:20,000 --> 00:37:21,099
Please give it back.

469
00:37:43,920 --> 00:37:45,119
Dropping that pride of yours

470
00:37:46,860 --> 00:37:47,920
just for his

471
00:37:47,920 --> 00:37:49,000
cheap trinket?

472
00:38:03,320 --> 00:38:04,079
What did you do to your hand?

473
00:38:11,900 --> 00:38:13,420
You cut yourself for this damn thing?

474
00:38:23,420 --> 00:38:24,800
Didn't I make it clear?

475
00:38:25,539 --> 00:38:26,500
Not a trace of

476
00:38:26,500 --> 00:38:27,480
another man on you!

477
00:38:27,480 --> 00:38:28,119
Let go!

478
00:38:29,659 --> 00:38:30,400
Let go!

479
00:38:40,300 --> 00:38:41,000
Since words don't stick,

480
00:38:42,579 --> 00:38:43,760
I'll make sure you feel it.

481
00:38:44,559 --> 00:38:45,900
What are you doing?

482
00:38:46,519 --> 00:38:47,260
Stop!

483
00:38:47,739 --> 00:38:49,519
Let go of me!

484
00:38:50,139 --> 00:38:50,820
Get off!

485
00:38:54,760 --> 00:38:55,420
No!

486
00:39:02,099 --> 00:39:02,920
Don't!

487
00:39:03,179 --> 00:39:03,980
Please...

488
00:39:06,260 --> 00:39:07,059
I'm begging you...

489
00:39:08,360 --> 00:39:09,420
Please don't...

490
00:39:17,059 --> 00:39:18,139
Don't...

491
00:41:11,400 --> 00:41:12,820
[Master Yu, I've got it.]

492
00:41:12,820 --> 00:41:13,760
[Her mother told me]

493
00:41:13,800 --> 00:41:15,119
[Miss Ye loves the chicken soup dumplings]

494
00:41:15,119 --> 00:41:16,780
[from the Old Table.]

495
00:41:26,760 --> 00:41:27,679
Yu Changxuan,

496
00:41:28,820 --> 00:41:30,059
what the hell is wrong with you?
